<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>
    <link href="/css/GenericTheme.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>My account</title>
    <style>
      * body{
        overflow:hidden;
      }

      .menu-button {
        color: white;
      }
    </style>

</head>
<body>
    <header>
      <section class="header-bar">
        <nav>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/user/shop" class="smooth-link">Shop</a></li>
            <li><a href="/user/orders" class="smooth-link">Orders</a></li>
            <li><a href="/user/settings" class="smooth-link">Settings</a></li>
            <li><a href="/user/contact_us_page" class="smooth-link">Contact Us</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </section>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div style="display: grid;grid-template-columns: 20vw 80vw;">
        <div style="background-color: rgb(130 72 24); height: 100vh; box-shadow: 11px 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); z-index: 100;">
          <a href="/logout"><img src="/imgs/home.png" alt="Home" style="width:30px; height:30px;padding:15px;"></a>
          
          <h1 style="text-align: center;padding: 40px 0px;">Welcome, <%= session[:uname] %>! </h1>
        </div>
        
        <div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 100vh;">
          <img src="/imgs/dashboard.png" alt="Dashboard" style="width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: fill;"></a>

          <div style="display: flex;flex-direction: row;flex-wrap: wrap;justify-content: center;gap: 32px;height: 85vh;position: absolute;top: 10vh;">
            <div style="color: black;background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;max-width:35vw;">
              <h1>Coffee counter</h1>
              <p><%= Users.GetLoyaltyPoints(session[:userId]) %></p>
            </div>

            <div style="color: black;background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;max-width:35vw;">
              <h1>History of BBC</h1>
              <p>Write some waffle about how we collect jorge beans from the wild side and then how we process and crack the beans to get to the raw coffee inside.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="color: black;background: transparent;backdrop-filter: blur(15px);box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px #0000007a;border-radius: 30px; text-align: center;">
              <h1>Discounts / Recent Transactions</h1>
              <p>From Database Data</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>

    </footer>
</body>